<h2 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Administrator Account Created</h2>
<p>An administrator account was automatically provisioned during the system startup.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin: 24px 0; background-color: #1E1E24; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #3A3A4A;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 16px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #FFFFFF;"><strong>Email:</strong> {{ Email }}</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #FFFFFF;"><strong>Password:</strong> {{ Password }}</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Please log in immediately and securely store this password in your organization's password manager.</p>

<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 24px;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" bgcolor="#4CE5E5" style="border-radius: 8px;">
      <a href="{{ WebDashboardUrl }}" target="_blank" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; text-decoration: none; color: #1E1E24; padding: 12px 24px; display: inline-block; border-radius: 8px;">Login to Dashboard</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
